	(text "74HCT541: TTL inputs (3.3 V = high), 5 V gate drive. OE (G1/G2) tied to GND.\n100k pull-downs on inputs and gates: all MOSFETs off during reset/boot.\nLow-side WSD4070DN33 (40 V, 7.6 mOhm max at 4.5 V); fuse 5 A in the +24 V lead.\nTerminal: pin 1 = +24V (fused, behind the cutoff), pin 2 = HEATER- (drain)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
